	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia et pax a deo patre nostro, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>et domino Iesu Christo.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/><persName ref="p20673">Nicolaus Balbanus</persName>, charissimus frater noster et ecclesiae senior, petiturus est aliquid a <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>vobis nostro omnium nomine, quod quidem impetrare cum vehementissime cupimus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tum maxime indigemus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Rogamus vos, ut hominem pro vestra humanitate benigne <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>audiatis eique omnem fidem adhibeatis.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Valete, optimi atque integerrimi viri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Dominus Iesus Christus vobis adsit, suis divinis beneficiis vos et ecclesiam vestram in<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>dies magis magisque augeat et cumulet vestrumque laborem in ea fructuosum reddat.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/><placeName ref="l167">Genevae</placeName> calendis septembris 1557.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Qui vos summa observantia colunt, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>seniores et diaconi et tota <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ecclesia <placeName ref="l834">Italorum</placeName>, qui sunt <placeName ref="l167">Genevae</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Venerandis patribus et fidelibus <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Christi ministris pastoribus ec(clesi<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ae) <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> nobis in domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>summa observantia colend s.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
